# Everything in a bundle is consumed inside a Linux container, so line endings must
# survive a checkout on any host. Without this, git's core.autocrlf on Windows rewrites
# these to CRLF on clone and `git apply` inside the container rejects the patch
# ("corrupt patch at line N") - a real failure mode this project already hit once.
*.diff      text eol=lf
*.patch     text eol=lf
*.py        text eol=lf
*.json      text eol=lf
*.md        text eol=lf
*.txt       text eol=lf
*.toml      text eol=lf
Dockerfile  text eol=lf
*.sh        text eol=lf
